{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireworks Incremental</strong> is an incremental game about fireworks. You start small with a single mortar firing small fireworks. Each explosion generates money, which you can spend on a variety of upgrades to make even bigger, better and more colourful fireworks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an active incremental gameplay about fireworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy upgrades to make better fireworks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >construct new buildings and unlock new resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hire workers to speed things up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >prestige once you feel you've made enough progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an incremental game with an ending</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >beautiful, retro pixel art fireworks</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950670?t=1761761550","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950670?t=1761761550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950670/05ad9c004234c06705d6d819d88558294d76161b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761761550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950670/05ad9c004234c06705d6d819d88558294d76161b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761761550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireworks Incremental</strong> is an incremental game about fireworks. You start small with a single mortar firing small fireworks. Each explosion generates money, which you can spend on a variety of upgrades to make even bigger, better and more colourful fireworks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><